{"title":"Victor Niederhoffer, RIP","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/966445367/0/marginalrevolution~Victor-Niederhoffer-RIP.html","date":1785909891000,"content":"<p>In addition to his well-known public roles, he worked very hard to help and befriend me when I was younger.  Here are <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.google.com/search?q=victor+niederhoffer&amp;sca_esv=d0b419d1da6f3190&amp;sxsrf=APpeQntzRJrTozlxfQCB_UhUBOeBVmloRQ%3A1785909776512&amp;source=hp&amp;ei=ENJyatOQHNq1i-gP_cDVyQg&amp;iflsig=ABILxe8AAAAAanLgIPmDF2Uub3Rae_MDGQPZbJUSgVDY&amp;gs_ssp=eJzj4tTP1TcwKyg3MDVg9BIuy0wuyS9SyMtMTUktyshPS0stAgCgagrH&amp;oq=victor+nid&amp;gs_lp=Egdnd3Mtd2l6Igp2aWN0b3IgbmlkKgIIADIJEC4YChgLGIAEMgkQABiABBgKGAsyCRAAGIAEGAoYCzIJEAAYgAQYChgLMgkQABiABBgKGAsyCRAAGIAEGAoYCzIJEAAYgAQYChgLMgkQABiABBgKGAsyCRAAGIAEGAoYCzIJEC4YgAQYChgLSOkcUABY_QtwAHgAkAEBmAGMAqABuwyqAQUxLjcuMrgBAcgBAPgBAZgCCaACvgvCAgUQABiABMICCxAuGIAEGMcBGNEDwgILEC4YgAQYxwEYrwHCAgUQLhiABJgDAJIHBTEuNy4xoAeEoQGyBwUxLjcuMbgHvgvCBwUyLTUuNMgHQoAIAQ&amp;sclient=gws-wiz\" target=\"_blank\">the Google searches for Victor</a>.  Less well known about Victor is that he had one of the world’s best collections of private letters.  He also once gave me a very nice small painting by Jack Savitzky, for which I remain grateful.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/08/victor-niederhoffer-rip.html\">Victor Niederhoffer, RIP</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/966445367/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/966445367/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/966445367/margin